It seems that changing https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/blob/8b50836d76bbfd33f203887f4ea431e23f0344e4/src/display/editor/freetext.js#L488-L489 into
```javascript
 const [tx, ty] = this.getInitialTranslation(); 
 this.setAt(baseX * parentWidth, baseY * parentHeight, tx, ty); 
```
might fix the *vertical* position, however the horizontal position would still be off slightly.
